样方法"}, {"widget": {"name": "round_to_multiple"}, "name": "round_to_multiple", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "倍数取整"}, {"widget": {"name": "scale_to_side"}, "name": "scale_to_side", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "缩放到边"}, {"widget": {"name": "scale_to_length"}, "name": "scale_to_length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "缩放到长度"}, {"widget": {"name": "background_color"}, "name": "background_color", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "background_color"}], "flags": {}, "id": 25, "type": "LayerUtility: ImageScaleByAspectRatio V2", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: ImageScaleByAspectRatio V2"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [462.7657775878906, 478.1611022949219], "pos": [133.49520874023438, 740.2626953125], "widgets_values": ["This is a beautifully composed, atmospheric portrait of a young woman standing alone in an open field during twilight.\n\n**Subject and Pose:**\nThe central figure is a woman with dark hair that flows dynamically around her face and shoulders, suggesting she is caught in a gentle breeze or wind. She has her eyes closed or looking downcast, conveying a sense of introspection, melancholy, or peaceful solitude. Her arms are wrapped tightly across her chest, hugging herself—a gesture that can imply self-comfort, vulnerability, or protection from the elements or emotional state.\n\nShe is dressed in flowing white attire; what appears to be a long, loose-fitting dress adorned with subtle embroidery or patterns, which billows softly around her legs as if moved by air. Draped over her shoulders like a shawl or wrap is a soft gray scarf, whose fringed edges flutter dramatically against the backdrop.\n\n**Setting and Atmosphere:**\nThe scene takes place outdoors in a vast, grassy meadow filled with tall blades of green and brown vegetation that reach up towards her knees. The background features a distant, blurred horizon line where faint silhouettes of trees or low hills might lie just beyond the field.\nAbove, the sky dominates the upper half of the frame, painted in cool tones—deep blues and grays—with wispy clouds scattered throughout. A sliver of warm light breaks through on the right side of the composition near the horizon, casting a golden glow onto some cloud formations and illuminating strands of her hair and fabric—the only source of warmth in the otherwise muted palette.\n\n**Lighting and Composition:**\nThe lighting is characteristic of dusk or dawn (the \"blue hour\"), creating high contrast between shadowed areas and highlights. Backlighting comes primarily from behind and slightly above her head, rimming her silhouette and making her hair appear luminous and ethereal while leaving much of her body in softer shadows. This technique adds depth and drama without harshness.\nHer position within the frame is centered but not static; there’s movement suggested both in her posture and surroundings. The shallow depth-of-field keeps focus sharply on her form while rendering the foreground and background into smooth gradients of color and texture.\n\nOverall, the photograph evokes strong emotions related to solitude, contemplation, quiet resilience, and perhaps even loneliness. It's serene yet poignant—an artistic capture meant to stir feelings rather than simply document reality. The mood feels cinematic and timeless, inviting viewers to ponder the story unfolding silently before them."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 23, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 24, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [20, 24], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [386.450927734375, 536.953857421875], "pos": [-284.3060